" data-name=\"skillet beans calories cell\">410</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-6-5\" data-name=\"skillet beans flags cell\"><span class=\"flags\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-6-5-1\" data-name=\"skillet beans flag chips\"><span class=\"flag\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-6-5-1-1\" data-name=\"dietary flag chip (vegan)\">vegan</span><span class=\"flag\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-6-5-1-2\" data-name=\"dietary flag chip (gluten free)\">gluten free</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"page-foot\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"page footer spacer\"></div>\n</main>\n</div>",
